\ A genuine type error at a locked polymorphic comparison site. No method covers
\ a string and a fixnum anywhere in the frozen table and no `cmp` method derives
\ an ordering for the pair, so the cold arm's lookup misses and the site traps.
\
\ The trap reproduces the native's own error tail rather than naming the dispatch
\ machinery, so a locked binary reports what the interpreter reports.
\ tests/integration/mixed_compare_miss.1z runs the same program interpreted and
\ pins the same message.

pick-num: ( b -- n ) [ [ 7 ] [ "x" ] if ] ;

f pick-num 3 < drop
